<title>USA: Data Broadcasting names president/COO.</title>
<headline>Data Broadcasting names president/COO.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSON, Wyo. 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Data Broadcasting Corp said Wednesday it had promoted Mark Imperiale to the newly created positions of president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Imperiale will continue in his current position as chief financial officer until a replacement is found, the company said.</p>
